---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy — Cookie-less by default" description="No cookies until consent. GA fires only after Consent Mode v2 granted. Fonts self-host when possible, Cal.com as processor, rights per GDPR/CCPA.">
  <section class="bg-[var(--ls-cream)] py-12 md:py-16">
    <div class="ls-inner max-w-[880px]">
      <h1 class="font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em] text-[clamp(1.9rem,4vw,2.6rem)]">Privacy</h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-[var(--ls-text-secondary)]">Marketing site is static and private by design. Last updated 2026-08-27.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="ls-shell max-w-[880px] prose prose-zinc max-w-none">
    <div class="rounded-[16px] bg-white border border-[var(--ls-card-border)] p-6 space-y-4 text-[0.92rem] text-[var(--ls-text-secondary)]">
      <h2 class="font-semibold text-[var(--ls-ink)]">What we collect</h2>
      <p>Pageviews via Cloudflare Web Analytics (cookie-less, no banner) or Plausible self-host. GA4 only after you click <em>Accept</em> (Consent Mode v2 <code>analytics_storage: granted</code>). No raw IP in logs (hash day-bucketed).</p>
      <h2 class="font-semibold text-[var(--ls-ink)]">Forms & scheduling</h2>
      <p>Contact form → Formspree/Tally (processor) → email. Cal.com handles scheduling (see <a href="https://cal.com/privacy" class="underline">cal.com/privacy</a>). We never put PII in URL, never log <code>email</code> verbatim beyond delivery.</p>
      <h2 class="font-semibold text-[var(--ls-ink)]">Fonts & embeds</h2>
      <p>Google Fonts <code>preconnect</code> today; self-host via <code>@fontsource</code> in next iteration to drop <code>fonts.gstatic.com</code> from CSP. YouTube uses <code>youtube-nocookie.com</code>, Vimeo <code>player.vimeo.com</code> — both <code>frame-src</code> allowlisted only.</p>
      <h2 class="font-semibold text-[var(--ls-ink)]">Your rights</h2>
      <p>Access/delete: email <a href="mailto:privacy@lightspeedholdings.com" class="underline">privacy@lightspeedholdings.com</a>. Data retained per <code>data/governance.py</code> (leads 365d → archive). Controller: LightSpeed Holdings.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
